Source Availability
===================

The complete corresponding source code of this project is available at:
https://github.com/MingChuLab/ESP32-Flash-Tool

Source code and full license texts for all third-party components are
publicly available at the upstream URLs listed above. When distributing
the standalone executable (PyInstaller build), the bundled esptool
(GPLv2+) source can be obtained from its upstream repository, and the
PySide6/Qt (LGPLv3) libraries may be replaced by relinking against a
user-supplied Qt for Python installation.
